{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-posbackend001",
		"name": "POS Backend API",
		"description": "API del POS (Laravel).\n\n**Registro inicial (app sin catálogo):** `POST /api/auth/register-device` con `Device-Fingerprint` + `Pairing-Token` (cabeceras o JSON `device_fingerprint`, `pairing_token`). El código de 6 dígitos se genera en el panel admin → Localidades (icono llave por fila, por sede). Crea dispositivo + licencia y devuelve `token`, `license_key`, `location_id`, `location_name`, `valid_from` y `valid_to` (ISO 8601, vigencia de la licencia). `license_key` es el UUID de la licencia (usar en login). El UUID del dispositivo está en **GET /api/auth/me** (`id`). Si la huella ya estaba registrada (reinstalación de la app), con un código válido devuelve de nuevo token (misma forma que el alta).\n\n**Login posterior (ya tiene catálogo / licencia):** `POST /api/auth/login` con `Device-Fingerprint` + `License-Key` (o JSON `device_fingerprint`, `license_key`). Respuesta: `token`, `license_key`, `location_id`, `location_name` (sin `device_id` ni `license_id`; el UUID del dispositivo está en **GET /api/auth/me**). Respuesta 403 si la licencia no está activa.\n\n**GET /api/sync/pull** devuelve `syncTimestamp` y `data`: `license` (incluye `deviceFingerprint`, la huella del terminal; no UUID de dispositivo), `users`, `families`, `subfamilies`, `products`, `paymentMethods` (camelCase). Obligatorio `device_fingerprint` en query (o `deviceFingerprint`) o cabecera `Device-Fingerprint`, misma huella que en login.\n\nCabecera: `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` (Sanctum, modelo `Device`).",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000"
		},
		{
			"key": "token",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "device_id",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "license_id",
			"value": "",
			"description": "Opcional; no se devuelve en login/register (usar license_key)."
		},
		{
			"key": "license_key",
			"value": "",
			"description": "UUID de la licencia; usar en POST /api/auth/login."
		},
		{
			"key": "device_fingerprint",
			"value": "",
			"description": "Huella única del terminal Android."
		},
		{
			"key": "pairing_token",
			"value": "",
			"description": "Código de 6 dígitos del panel admin (solo registro inicial)."
		},
		{
			"key": "last_sync_timestamp",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "location_id",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "location_name",
			"value": "",
			"description": "Nombre de la sede (respuesta register-device y login)."
		},
		{
			"key": "cashier_user_id",
			"value": "",
			"description": "UUID de un usuario cajero del local (p. ej. de `data.users` tras Pull)."
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register device (pairing)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var j = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (j.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token); }",
									"    if (j.license_key) { pm.collectionVariables.set('license_key', j.license_key); }",
									"    if (j.location_id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('location_id', j.location_id); }",
									"    if (j.location_name) { pm.collectionVariables.set('location_name', j.location_name); }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Device-Fingerprint",
								"value": "{{device_fingerprint}}",
								"description": "Opcional si envías el cuerpo JSON."
							},
							{
								"key": "Pairing-Token",
								"value": "{{pairing_token}}",
								"description": "Código de 6 dígitos."
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"device_fingerprint\": \"{{device_fingerprint}}\",\n  \"pairing_token\": \"{{pairing_token}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register-device",
						"description": "Vincula el terminal con el código del panel (Dispositivos). Si la huella ya existía, devuelve token con el mismo formato que el alta (p. ej. app reinstalada). Invalida el código al tener éxito."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var j = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (j.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token); }",
									"    if (j.license_key) { pm.collectionVariables.set('license_key', j.license_key); }",
									"    if (j.location_id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('location_id', j.location_id); }",
									"    if (j.location_name) { pm.collectionVariables.set('location_name', j.location_name); }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Device-Fingerprint",
								"value": "{{device_fingerprint}}"
							},
							{
								"key": "License-Key",
								"value": "{{license_key}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"device_fingerprint\": \"{{device_fingerprint}}\",\n  \"license_key\": \"{{license_key}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
						"description": "Sesión cuando la app ya tiene el catálogo: valida huella + license_key (único por licencia). Respuesta 403 si la licencia no está activa."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Me",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var j = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (j.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('device_id', j.id); }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Sync",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Pull catalog (full)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var j = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (j.syncTimestamp) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('last_sync_timestamp', j.syncTimestamp);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": "{{base_url}}/api/sync/pull?device_fingerprint={{device_fingerprint}}",
						"description": "Primera sync: sin `lastSyncTimestamp`. Requiere `device_fingerprint` = misma huella que en Login (variable `device_fingerprint`). Alternativa: cabecera `Device-Fingerprint`."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Pull catalog (incremental)",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": "{{base_url}}/api/sync/pull?device_fingerprint={{device_fingerprint}}&lastSyncTimestamp={{last_sync_timestamp}}",
						"description": "Pon en `last_sync_timestamp` el `syncTimestamp` de un pull anterior (la variable se rellena sola tras **Pull catalog (full)**). ISO 8601 o ms Unix. Misma huella que en Login."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Push transactions",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"transactions\": [\n    {\n      \"external_id\": \"demo-ext-{{$guid}}\",\n      \"shift_id\": null,\n      \"user_id\": \"{{cashier_user_id}}\",\n      \"turn_number\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"PAID\",\n      \"total\": 10.5,\n      \"occurred_at\": \"2026-04-03T15:00:00\",\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"product_id\": null,\n          \"product_name\": \"Producto demo\",\n          \"product_sku\": \"SKU-1\",\n          \"qty\": 1,\n          \"unit_price\": 10.5,\n          \"discount\": 0,\n          \"tax\": 0,\n          \"line_total\": 10.5\n        }\n      ],\n      \"payments\": [\n        {\n          \"payment_method\": \"CASH\",\n          \"amount\": 10.5,\n          \"reference\": null\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{base_url}}/api/sync/push",
						"description": "Respuesta 200: `{ \"success\": true, \"stored\": <n> }` (`stored` = transacciones nuevas en ese envío). Rellena `cashier_user_id` con el UUID (36 caracteres) de un usuario POS que exista en BD (p. ej. **Pull** → `data.users` → `id`). No uses prefijos tipo `demo_id` ni concatener texto al UUID. `shift_id`: opcional, **texto libre** del POS (p. ej. `T1`), máx. 100 caracteres, o `null`; no tiene que existir en la tabla `shifts`. `external_id` distinto en cada envío. `occurred_at`: ISO 8601 o Unix segundos/milisegundos (como Pull)."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Reports",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Dashboard (today)",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": "{{base_url}}/api/reports/dashboard",
						"description": "Query opcional: `?location_id=` para filtrar."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Dashboard by location_id",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": "{{base_url}}/api/reports/dashboard?location_id={{location_id}}",
						"description": "Usa `location_id` guardado tras Login, o pega un UUID manualmente."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "By location",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": "{{base_url}}/api/reports/by-location"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
